AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBCS_0000233> "transformed data item"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBCS_0000233> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000312> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200000>)))
